      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wondering what is the plan for v6.15 regarding reusing all that code from arch/x86/kernel/fpu/ : shall we still have copies of that code, like in this patchset, or shall we add these `#ifdef __PKVM_HYP__` directly to that code and compile it into hypervisor code (like we are planning for KVM code)?",
      "revId": "cfdf307e19fef84de3ec7a49b1a104ea96f6b407",
